  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **I Play It Off Legit**: rare: 13 archived performances [3]\n- **Are You Experienced**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **Ween2017-10-31.km140248722** (recommended): source not stated; 32 songs; 152 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]. Said about its sound: Instruments are balanced perfectly, Gener sounds great, and crowd noise is present in just the right amount [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Deaner played bass and Dave played guitar at this show [1]\n- Reviewer, who collects recordings of shows they attended, calls this the best-sounding of those recordings [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **Ween2017-10-31.km140248722**: taped by Melissa Fry; transferred by Melissa Fry; source: Nuemann KM140> Oade m248> Sound Devices 722 [1]. Also: Tim Fraley and Chris Cage loaned the recording rig used for this taping [1]",
